{"id":"word:hebrew:H8537","type":"word","title":"תֹּם","subtitle":"H8537 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"completeness ; figuratively, prosperity ; usually (morally) innocence","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תֹּם (H8537) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 24 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תֹּם (tôm) means completeness ; figuratively, prosperity ; usually (morally) innocence First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 9 4."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תֹּם","transliteration":"tôm","pronunciation":"tome","strong":"H8537","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8537","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["בְּ/תָם","לְ/תֻמּ֔/וֹ","בְּ/תֻמּ֑/וֹ","לְ/תֻמָּ֑/ם","בְ/תָם"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncmsc",5],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",5],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp1cs",3],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",2],["HNcmsa",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Ncmsc",1],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",1],["HVqc",1],["HNcmsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"completeness ; figuratively, prosperity ; usually (morally) innocence","usage":"full, integrity, perfect(-ion), simplicity, upright(-ly, -ness), at a venture. See 8550 .","full":"H8537. tom תֹּם noun [masculine] completeness, integrity ; — תֹּם absolute Prov 10:20 +; construct Job 4:6 ; Psa 78:72 , construct also תָּםֿ Prov 13:6 4 t.; suffix תֻּמִּי Psa 26:1 11 t. suffix; plural תֻּמִּים Exod 28:30 3 t.; suffix תֻּמֶּיךָ Deut 33:8 ; — 1 completeness, fullness : כְּתֻמָּם Isa 47:9 according to their full measure ; תֻּמּוֺ בְּעֶצֶם Job 21:23 in his very completeness. 2 innocence, simplicity: לתמם הלכים 2Sam 15:11 ; לְתֻמּוֺ בַּקֶּשֶׁת מֶשַׁךְ 1Kin 22:34 2Chr 18:33 , i.e. without definite aim. 3 integrity: לֵבָב תֹּם integrity of mind Gen 20:5-6 , (E), 1Kin 9:4 ; Psa 78:72 ; 101:2 ; תָּםדֶּֿרֶךְ Prov 13:6 ; Job 4:6 ; בַּתֹּם (הת)הלך Prov 10:9 , בְּתֻמּוֺ 19:1 ; 20:7 ; 28:6 , בְּתֻמִּי Psa 26:1 ; 26:11 ; תֹם הֹלְכֵי Prov 2:7 ; וָישֶׁר תֹּם Psa 25:21 ; בְּתֻמִּי 41:13 ; כְּתֻמִּי 7:9 ; לַתֹּם מָעוֺז Prov 10:29 . 4 תֻּמִּים in וְתֻמִּים אוּרִים (meaning dubious, see, אורים ) Deut 33:8 ; Exod 28:30 (P) Lev 8:8 (P), Ezra 2:63 = Neh 7:65 ; + 1Sam 14:41 (for תָּמִים ) We Dr Bu HPS; also Hosea 3:4 (for תרפים Che JQ. July 1899, 564 and 4:5 ( תֻּמֶּ֑יךָ for אִמֶּ֑ךָ ) Ruben JQ. April 1899, 44 Che l.c .","rootNote":"from 8552 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 9 4","keyReferences":["1Kgs 9 4","1Kgs 22 34","2Chr 18 33","2Sam 15 11","Gen 20 5","Gen 20 6","Isa 47 9","Job 4 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":24,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 9 4","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/תָם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 34","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/תֻמּ֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 18 33","book":"2Chr","chapter":18,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/תֻמּ֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Sam 15 11","book":"2Sam","chapter":15,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/תֻמָּ֑/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Gen 20 5","book":"Gen","chapter":20,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/תָם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Gen 20 6","book":"Gen","chapter":20,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/תָם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Isa 47 9","book":"Isa","chapter":47,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כְּ/תֻמָּ/ם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Job 4 6","book":"Job","chapter":4,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תֹ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Job 21 23","book":"Job","chapter":21,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תֻּמּ֑/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Lev 25 29","book":"Lev","chap